---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="InTellMe"
  description="InTellMe is a research company in Johnson City, Tennessee. We build a checkpoint that AI systems run before they act, plus a few everyday apps that grew out of that work."
  path="/"
>

  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-line">
    <picture>
      <img class="hero__still" src="/hero.webp" alt=""
           width="1680" height="945" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
    </picture>
    <div class="hero__veil" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="suite suite--flagship hero__inner">
      <h1 class="hero-line" id="hero-line">Before an AI acts on something, it should know whether it&rsquo;s true.</h1>
      <hr class="rule--champagne" />
      <p class="hero-support">InTellMe is a research company in Johnson City, Tennessee. We build a checkpoint that AI systems run before they take action. It looks at where their information came from and whether it holds up. We also make a few everyday apps that grew out of that work.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="https://truvector.science" rel="noopener">Visit TruVector</a>
        <a class="btn btn--secondary" href="/investors">For investors</a>
        <a class="btn btn--tertiary" href="https://www.researchone.io/" rel="noopener">Try ResearchOne <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
